# @kidsapp/shared

This package is the contract. Both `server` and `apps/mobile` import it.

- Export types, unions, and constants from `src/index.ts`. Do not put Express or React code here.
- After edits: `npm run build -w @kidsapp/shared` (or leave `npm run dev -w @kidsapp/shared` watching).
- Consumers read `dist/` — a type that is not built will fail at runtime/import.
- Keep gamification numbers here (`DAILY_STAR_*`, wheel segments, badges, XP curve) so UI and server stay in sync.
